Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.40,0:00:03.97,Black,,0,0,0,,Umayuru: Pretty Gray
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.58,0:00:09.68,Black,,0,0,0,,Hoje vamos testar a corrida para o próximo Fan Fest de Primavera
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.16,0:00:08.20,draw-white,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&H00&\an7\fscx100\fscy100\p1\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(1344,846)}m 0 -1 l -1 105 l 472 105 l 439 52 l 473 0 m 266 198
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.16,0:00:08.20,textbox,,0,0,0,,{\fs70\pos(1558,894)\c&H8747B4&}Biwa Hayahide
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.68,0:00:14.81,Black,,0,0,0,,Neste ano estamos planejando ter um revezamento diferente de todos os outros.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.25,0:00:17.04,draw-white,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&H00&\an7\fscx100\fscy100\p1\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(1390,78)}m 0 -1 l -1 105 l 472 105 l 439 52 l 473 0 m 266 198
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.25,0:00:17.04,draw-white,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&H00&\an7\fscx100\fscy100\p1\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(156,898)}m 0 -1 l -1 105 l 472 105 l 439 52 l 473 0 m 266 198
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.25,0:00:17.04,textbox,,0,0,0,,{\fs70\c&H492FCD&\pos(372,942)}No Reason
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.25,0:00:17.04,textbox,,0,0,0,,{\fs70\pos(1614,128)\c&HCF7CE6&}Narita Taishin
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.81,0:00:17.81,Black,,0,0,0,,Nossas corredoras na primeira etapa serão a Taishin e a No Reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.81,0:00:19.37,draw-white,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&H00&\an7\fscx100\fscy100\p1\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(184,76)}m 0 -1 l -1 105 l 472 105 l 439 52 l 473 0 m 266 198
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.81,0:00:19.37,textbox,,0,0,0,,{\fs70\pos(400,126)\c&H1EBADB&}Tanino Gimlet
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.81,0:00:19.37,draw-white,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&H00&\an7\fscx100\fscy100\p1\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(1386,902)}m 0 -1 l -1 105 l 472 105 l 439 52 l 473 0 m 266 198
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.81,0:00:19.37,textbox,,0,0,0,,{\fs70\pos(1600,950)\c&H6448DE&}Winning Ticket
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.81,0:00:20.37,Black,,0,0,0,,Na segunda etapa, correrão a Ticket e a Gimlet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.37,0:00:22.29,Black,,0,0,0,,E finalmente a última etapa será entre eu
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.29,0:00:23.08,Black,,0,0,0,,e...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.08,0:00:24.14,Black,,0,0,0,,Você, Hishi Miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.08,0:00:25.20,draw-white,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&H00&\an7\fscx100\fscy100\p1\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(1066,868)}m 0 -1 l -1 105 l 472 105 l 439 52 l 473 0 m 266 198
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.08,0:00:25.20,textbox,,0,0,0,,{\fs70\pos(1286,918)\c&HB77953&}Hishi Miracle
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.14,0:00:24.69,Black,,0,0,0,,Ótimo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.69,0:00:26.48,Black,,0,0,0,,Sim. Parece bom para mim também.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.48,0:00:28.98,Black,,0,0,0,,Hah. "Ótimo" subestima o decreto do nosso destino.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.98,0:00:32.12,Black,,0,0,0,,Que coisa... Não sei o que eu fiz para receber tamanha responsabilidade...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.12,0:00:34.98,Black,,0,0,0,,Mas eu vou me esforçar!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.98,0:00:37.20,Black,,0,0,0,,Beleza! Vamos lá!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.51,0:00:41.40,Black,,0,0,0,,Você é bem rápida...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.40,0:00:42.98,Black,,0,0,0,,Mas nada temo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.98,0:00:45.98,Black,,0,0,0,,Pois os ventos da batalha logo ficarão ao meu favor!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.18,0:00:48.98,Black,,0,0,0,,Ticket!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.98,0:00:50.26,Black,,0,0,0,,Gimlet!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.26,0:00:52.68,Black,,0,0,0,,Rraaaaah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.42,0:00:54.50,Black,,0,0,0,,Hayahide!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.50,0:00:56.02,Black,,0,0,0,,O bastão é meu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.02,0:00:57.69,Black,,0,0,0,,E agora... Eu vou vencer!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.34,0:01:02.96,Black,,0,0,0,,U-uma piscina?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.50,0:01:05.00,Black,,0,0,0,,{\fnGrandstander\fs50\pos(552,950)}{\pos(744,936)}*Modificações foram feitas com a permissão da academia.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.96,0:01:04.61,Black,,0,0,0,,A última etapa é um curso especial!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.80,0:01:09.16,Black,,0,0,0,,M-mas eu consigo!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.16,0:01:11.02,Black,,0,0,0,,Eu também quero vencer!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.27,0:01:13.95,Black,,0,0,0,,Aablub blurbblb...Pwah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.95,0:01:15.10,Black,,0,0,0,,Eu vou na frente.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.62,0:01:18.04,Black,,0,0,0,,{\fnGrandstander\fs50\pos(476,948)}{\pos(744,936)}*Obstáculo colocado com permissão da academia
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.30,0:01:20.24,Black,,0,0,0,,O qu-?! Aaaaagh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.96,0:01:22.45,Black,,0,0,0,,Agora este aqui não é problema!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.45,0:01:24.73,Black,,0,0,0,,Ooh, é uma disputa bem acirrada!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.73,0:01:27.11,Black,,0,0,0,,Uma batalha de dar inveja à Titanomaquia de eld!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.11,0:01:29.65,Black,,0,0,0,,Sim, mas onde é a linha de chegada?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.65,0:01:31.24,Black,,0,0,0,,Hmm, eu também não sei.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.24,0:01:32.79,Black,,0,0,0,,Hayahideee!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.79,0:01:35.54,Black,,0,0,0,,Onde é a linha de chegada?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.54,0:01:39.77,Black,,0,0,0,,Eu disse que seria um revezamento nunca antes visto, não foi?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.77,0:01:42.54,Black,,0,0,0,,Nós vamos correr com as sakuras pelo Japão!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.12,0:01:42.54,ja,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1004,158)}Corrida do Desabrochar
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.94,0:01:48.02,Black,,0,0,0,,Um revezamento conecta as pessoas de uma forma bela.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.02,0:01:52.14,Black,,0,0,0,,Trabalho em equipe brota, e corações desabrocham enquanto crescemos juntas.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.14,0:01:54.10,Black,,0,0,0,,igual às flores de sakura que enfeitam um mesmo galho.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.39,0:01:59.26,Black,,0,0,0,,O tempo de desabrochar de uma única árvore de sakura é curto—\Nmas juntas elas carregam a tocha da primavera bem longe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.26,0:02:03.19,Black,,0,0,0,,Por isso não podemos clamar a vitória\Na menos que também corramos essa mesma distância nós mesmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.19,0:02:06.19,Black,,0,0,0,,Huh? Mas então para onde que devemos ir?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.19,0:02:07.06,Black,,0,0,0,,Deixe me ver!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.06,0:02:09.73,COLOR,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&H00&\an7\fscx100\fscy100\p1\c&HBC88F5&\pos(966,474)} m 51 -360 l -619 -361 l -617 -214 l 51 -215
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.06,0:02:09.73,COLOR,,0,0,0,,{\fs100\pos(678,226)}Mapa das Sakuras
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.73,0:02:18.37,COLOR,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&H00&\an7\fscx100\fscy100\p1\c&HBC88F5&\pos(966,474)\clip(m 568 236 l 572 264 1011 265 1015 108 500 107 555 128 561 173)} m 51 -360 l -619 -361 l -617 -214 l 51 -215
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.73,0:02:18.37,COLOR,,0,0,0,,{\fs100\pos(678,226)\clip(m 568 236 l 572 264 1011 265 1015 108 500 107 555 128 561 173)}Mapa das Sakuras
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.06,0:02:10.06,Black,,0,0,0,,Ah! As sakuras já passaram por Kanto!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.06,0:02:13.39,Black,,0,0,0,,A primavera chega no sul primeiro, então ela está indo em direção ao norte!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.39,0:02:17.13,Black,,0,0,0,,Que poético. Nós buscamos por um horizonte sem fim.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.13,0:02:18.80,Black,,0,0,0,,Isso é bem legal!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.80,0:02:22.78,Black,,0,0,0,,Desse jeito isso nunca vai acabar—acabe com esse revezamento!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.78,0:02:24.13,Black,,0,0,0,,Não vou perder!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.13,0:02:26.70,Black,,0,0,0,,Você pode acabar com o revezamento—mas não com nosso desafio!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.23,0:02:29.18,Black,,0,0,0,,Vocês não podem estar sérias.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.18,0:02:31.63,Black,,0,0,0,,Vocês nem sabem para onde estão indo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.23,0:02:35.74,Black,,0,0,0,,Angels'd fall to feel that love tonight
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.74,0:02:38.64,Black,,0,0,0,,Embracin' the void tight when isolation calls
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.64,0:02:40.01,Black,,0,0,0,,(Whoa wow whoa oh)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.01,0:02:42.86,Black,,0,0,0,,The pain I resist, the pain I inflict
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.86,0:02:45.58,Black,,0,0,0,,This heat (so sweet) melds it all into bliss
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.58,0:02:48.28,Black,,0,0,0,,Angels'd seethe, knowing that love is mine
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.28,0:02:51.10,Black,,0,0,0,,The sugar and the spice, lingering in my mind
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.10,0:02:52.39,Black,,0,0,0,,(Whoa wow whoa oh)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.39,0:02:55.45,Black,,0,0,0,,I wish I could forget... Why won't our past relent?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.45,0:02:57.74,Black,,0,0,0,,White light (black night) marbled in my heart's
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.74,0:03:00.74,Black,,0,0,0,,Ashen memoir
